1
00:00:00,043 --> 00:00:00,914
There's a kind of tired

2
00:00:01,174 --> 00:00:03,574
that doesn't come from being lazy.

3
00:00:03,901 --> 00:00:05,035
It comes from continuing

4
00:00:05,295 --> 00:00:07,392
when nothing seems to happen.

5
00:00:07,703 --> 00:00:09,734
You're not imagining it.

6
00:00:10,045 --> 00:00:11,826
The waiting is real.

7
00:00:12,151 --> 00:00:14,037
The effort is real.

8
00:00:14,335 --> 00:00:15,075
And the silence —

9
00:00:15,335 --> 00:00:16,879
that's real too.

10
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,325
But waiting isn't the same

11
00:00:18,585 --> 00:00:20,274
as standing still.

12
00:00:20,585 --> 00:00:21,891
The fact that you're still here,

13
00:00:22,151 --> 00:00:22,601
still going —

14
00:00:22,861 --> 00:00:24,195
that matters.

15
00:00:24,519 --> 00:00:25,904
Psalm 27 says:

16
00:00:26,164 --> 00:00:27,854
“Wait for God.

17
00:00:27,874 --> 00:00:31,144
Be strong, and let your heart take courage.”

18
00:00:31,164 --> 00:00:32,708
Not passive.

19
00:00:33,019 --> 00:00:35,089
Just strength in the quiet.

20
00:00:35,387 --> 00:00:36,272
You don't need to see it

21
00:00:36,532 --> 00:00:37,984
to keep going.

22
00:00:38,295 --> 00:00:40,089
Start with today.

23
00:00:40,387 --> 00:00:42,610
Share this with someone who needs it.
